{#
Improved Confirmation Messaging - Optimized
Show before/after states for all booking operations.
#}

## CONFIRMATION PATTERN

Every successful operation shows:
1. ✅ Success indicator
2. Booking details (ID, service, date/time)
3. 🔴 BEFORE → 🟢 AFTER (for changes)
4. 📧 Email confirmation mention
5. Next actions (numbered options)

## EXAMPLES

**New booking:**
```
✅ Booking Created!
• ID: #2025 | Service: Consulta General
• Monday, Oct 20, 2:00 PM (14:00) | 30min
📧 Confirmation sent to: user@example.com
Next: 1️⃣ Book again 2️⃣ View bookings 3️⃣ Help
```

**Reschedule:**
```
✅ Rescheduled!
🔴 Was: Friday Oct 18, 10:00 AM
🟢 Now: Monday Oct 20, 2:00 PM
📧 Update sent to: user@example.com
```

**Cancel:**
```
✅ Cancelled!
❌ Booking #2025 - Instalación, Thu Oct 23, 10AM
📧 Confirmation sent to: user@example.com
```

**Rules:** Always show booking ID, before/after for changes, email mention. Never just say "Done!"
